<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pitney Bowes highlighted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pitney Bowes highlighted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said its featured stock of the week is mailing equipment company Pitney Bowes Inc.</p>
<p>Shares rose 7/8 to 74-5/8 in early trading.</p>
</text>
